\nSomeone ended up noticing it after all :sweat_smile: . Was thinking about fixing it at some point, but then again who in their right mind looks at the tests as long as they work.\r\n\r\nNot sure if this belongs in this PR, if not I can make a separate one. Up to you @pafuent\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2704057952/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2704077036","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103663#issuecomment-2704077036","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103663","id":2704077036,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hLPDs","user":{"login":"pafuent","id":6979945,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5Nzk5NDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6979945?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent","html_url":"https://github.com/pafuent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-06T14:52:38Z","updated_at":"2025-03-06T14:52:38Z","body":"@HolonProduction I did it in the last push, so it's fixed now","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2704077036/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2704939777","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103663#issuecomment-2704939777","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103663","id":2704939777,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hOhsB","user":{"login":"demolke","id":153469044,"node_id":"U_kgDOCSXAdA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153469044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/demolke","html_url":"https://github.com/demolke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/demolke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/demolke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/demolke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/demolke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/demolke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/demolke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/demolke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/demolke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/demolke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-06T21:05:11Z","updated_at":"2025-03-06T21:05:11Z","body":"Both errors triggered by the GLTF tests are results of how the import process works, how is it intertwined with Editor and the incomplete environment the test is able to setup.\r\n\r\n> ERROR: Unrecognized binary resource file: 'res://gltf_placed_in_dot_godot_imported.scn'.\r\n\r\nThis error was introduced by UIDs. The .scn file is not yet written to the disk when the UID logic tries to read the file and determine if it's a tscn or scn file. You can see it happens for all the cases that test editor import (as opposed to runtime import), they are all tagged with `[Editor]`\r\n\r\n> ERROR: EditorNode doesn't exist.\r\n\r\nThis was introduced in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99846 because previews can't be done during tests.\r\n\r\nBoth of the errors could be disabled with ERR_PRINT_OFF, they do not highlight anything meaningful, but am not sure if we should be blanket hiding errors.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2704939777/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707315342","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103663#issuecomment-2707315342","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103663","id":2707315342,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hXlqO","user":{"login":"pafuent","id":6979945,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5Nzk5NDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6979945?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent","html_url":"https://github.com/pafuent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T20:06:22Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T20:06:22Z","bod